      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "VIENNA ON SHOW (6) stalked the lead from a middle box and kept coming to win (24.74) at this track in Grade 5 over 435m. Solid formlines coming through his last run. In great form and can continue his winning ways. GO BARBARA (3) was well fancied last time and led throughout to score (26.48) at Warragul in a T3 RSTW over 460m. Can make it back-to-back wins. HAMMER ROSE (7) tackled far tougher grade latest but ran very well to hit the frame when 3rd (25.31) at this track in Grade 5. Was a winner the start prior in easier at Traralgon. The form from his last run is stacking up nicely. Expected to feature. RED TURTLE (1) can sneak into the finish with the right run.",
